# "each with mana value 3 or less": Bot1's graveyard holds Hired Blade (mana value 3, the boundary) and Argothian Elder (mana value 4) after Bot2's Wrath of
# God. Leonardo's Technique returns only the Blade and leaves the Elder - one target is enough for "one or two" (CR 115.1, 601.2c). The refusal for a graveyard
# of the Elder alone is leonardos-technique-is-not-offered-with-only-a-creature-card-of-mana-value-four.

